<%#
  Subscribed to the staff stream so a message that arrives while this is open
  lands in the thread without a refresh -- the guest writing again, or the bot
  answering, or a colleague replying from their own screen.

  Everything else the card is made of lives in HotelPortal::Inbox::Thread, so
  the page render and a live update cannot draw it two different ways.
%>
<%= turbo_stream_from conversation, :staff %>

<%= render HotelPortal::Inbox::Thread.new(
      conversation: conversation,
      messages: messages,
      hotel: current_hotel) %>
